<h1>Rye, third attempt</h1>
<div class="stamp">November, a Sunday</div>
<p>Two loaves went into the oven this morning. The first attempts were dense and sour in the wrong way, so this time I
changed one thing at a time and kept a note of each.</p>
<p>Seventy percent hydration, a long cold rest overnight and steam for the first ten minutes. The smell alone was worth
the early start. Back to the <a href="/">latest entries</a>.</p>
